{
  "_readme": [
    "THE PIN. bin/ is committed, vendored output — the emitted JavaScript of the",
    "capture client at capture.commit (D57 §DX2: npx on every Stop is a per-turn",
    "cold-fetch tax, so the tree ships instead of resolving). This file is the ONE",
    "place that commit is recorded; scripts/vendor_capture_bin.sh and CHANGELOG.md",
    "both derive from it, and scripts/check_bundle.mjs fails if a second copy of",
    "the live sha appears anywhere else in the repo.",
    "",
    "DO NOT HAND-EDIT EITHER HALF. bundle.digest and bundle.files are measured",
    "from bin/, so a hand-edit of one without the other is exactly the drift the",
    "gates catch. Re-vendor instead: scripts/vendor_capture_bin.sh rewrites bin/",
    "and this file together from a named capture commit.",
    "",
    "capture.npmVersion is the client version this bundle corresponds to. It is",
    "what scripts/check_npm_bundle.mjs would compare bin/ against — which it",
    "cannot do yet, because @vibe-commit/capture has never been published (D64)."
  ],
